<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 4,542 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 138.30 pence a kilo against 140.56 last week and 116.18 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the  89,169 pkgs sold so far this year is 129.51 pence against 114.18 pence for the 115,164 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
